# Platform app (apps/platform)

- Use App Router, TypeScript, @supabase/ssr for auth sessions.
- Save/load: API routes verify Supabase JWT server-side, then read/write local Postgres (Drizzle).
- Do not expose Postgres to the client. Do not use Supabase client for saves table from the browser.
- /play/[slug] loads iframe + postMessage bridge; validate postMessage origin both ways.
- Keep pages server-first; client components only where needed (iframe bridge, interactive UI).
